
[l_english.FOCUS_C12_FRIENDSHIP_OF_OUR_TOWN]
Friendship of Our Town

[l_english.FOCUS_C12_FRIENDSHIP_OF_OUR_TOWN_desc]
Maud Pie could still clearly remember the first time she met Starlight Glimmer.\n\nBack then, Starlight had been driven and lonely — obsessed with building a vast concentration camp, stripping other ponies of their magic and freedom in a desperate attempt to fill the wounds left in her heart since childhood.\n\nBut now, Starlight Glimmer had become the rightful and widely respected leader of the Resistance, the embodiment of hope and the will of Harmony itself.\n\nWas she doing well these days?\n\nNow, after countless dangers and detours, a device known as the “Starlight Radio” had finally been secretly delivered to Maud Pie.\n\nPerhaps… Maud could use it to have a conversation with Starlight Glimmer — across the distance, through the static, heart to heart.

[l_simp_chinese.FOCUS_C12_FRIENDSHIP_OF_OUR_TOWN]
平等镇的友谊

[l_simp_chinese.FOCUS_C12_FRIENDSHIP_OF_OUR_TOWN_desc]
石灰派仍清晰地记得她第一次见到星光熠熠的那一刻。那时的星光熠熠，执着而孤独，妄想建立一座庞大的集中营，剥夺其他小马的魔法与自由来填补她童年开始的内心创伤。然而，如今的星光熠熠成为了众望所归也当之无愧的抵抗军领袖，代表着希望和谐律的意志，她这些年过的还好吗？现在，一台“星光电台”历经重重险阻，终于被秘密送到了石灰派的面前。也许石灰派可以与星光熠熠来一次隔空的对话？
